WEBVTT

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.781
Eustace.
尤斯塔斯

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.578
No.
不

00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:19.377
Oh, cousin.
表弟

00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:23.381
I'm sorry.
很遗憾

00:00:23.464 --> 00:00:24.924
He was just a boy.
他还是个孩子

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:28.886
I never should have left him.
我真不应该离开他

00:00:33.725 --> 00:00:35.310
What could have happened to him?
他会出什么事呢？

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.022
In this place? Anything.
在这种地方，凶多吉少
而且他不是第一个

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.816
And he wasn't the first.
在这种地方，凶多吉少
而且他不是第一个

00:00:44.402 --> 00:00:45.987
It's Lord Octesian.
那是奥克特西安勋爵

00:00:49.407 --> 00:00:50.617
We should find his...
应该能找到他的…

00:00:52.994 --> 00:00:54.329
...sword.
宝剑

00:01:00.835 --> 00:01:03.254
(crewmen conversing)

00:01:03.338 --> 00:01:05.298
(screeching roar)

00:01:13.264 --> 00:01:14.390
What was that?
那是什么声音？

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:17.226
(screeching roar)
那是什么声音？

00:01:18.937 --> 00:01:20.438
Is it the volcano?
是火山爆发吗？

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:25.360
Oh, no... that's no volcano.
不，那不是火山

00:01:25.443 --> 00:01:27.195
All hands on deck there!
全体上船

00:01:29.113 --> 00:01:31.824
(screeching roar)

00:01:31.908 --> 00:01:34.577
Archers, arm yourselves!
弓箭手，做好准备

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.579
(wings flapping)
弓箭手，做好准备

00:01:39.582 --> 00:01:40.917
CREWMAN: Here, here.
拿着

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.752
FIRST MATE: Take one and pass them on.
接着，往下传

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.337
(deep grunt)
接着，往下传

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.341
(screeches)

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:53.388
(men shouting)

00:01:53.471 --> 00:01:56.182
Take your positions
and wait for my command!
各就各位

00:01:56.266 --> 00:01:57.600
(dragon roars)
听我的命令

00:01:57.684 --> 00:01:59.394
(grunts)

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:05.441
What's it doing?!
它想干什么？

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.068
Fire!
射箭

00:02:07.151 --> 00:02:09.445
-Fire!
-Fire!
射箭

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.531
(dragon roars)
射箭

00:02:11.614 --> 00:02:13.658
He'll break the mast.
它会弄折桅杆

00:02:16.744 --> 00:02:18.454
(all shouting)

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:19.789
Right!
没错

00:02:21.666 --> 00:02:23.501
DRINIAN: Hold your positions!
坚守阵地

00:02:23.585 --> 00:02:24.627
(growls)
坚守阵地

00:02:26.504 --> 00:02:27.922
-Fire!
-Fire!
-射箭
-射箭

00:02:28.006 --> 00:02:30.091
(roaring)

00:02:33.428 --> 00:02:35.638
Take... that!
吃我一剑

00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:37.640
(roaring)
吃我一剑

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.020
(crewmen cheering)

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:58.578
-Edmund! Ed!
-(grunts)
埃德蒙

00:03:03.124 --> 00:03:05.585
-Edmund!
-Lucy!
露西

00:03:09.672 --> 00:03:11.382
(Edmund grunts)

00:03:16.346 --> 00:03:19.223
(grunting, gasping)

00:03:23.144 --> 00:03:24.520
(gasping)

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:34.572
You have got to be joking.
搞什么名堂？

00:03:40.912 --> 00:03:42.705
(Eustace growls)

00:03:45.041 --> 00:03:47.585
He must have been tempted
by the treasure.
你一定受到了宝藏的诱惑

00:03:48.878 --> 00:03:51.381
CASPIAN: Well, anyone knows
a dragon's treasure is enchanted.
龙的宝藏注定会被施魔法
大家都知道

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:52.465
(snarls)

00:03:52.548 --> 00:03:54.175
Well, anyone from here.
这里的人都知道

00:04:06.229 --> 00:04:07.689
(pained roar)

00:04:10.066 --> 00:04:11.734
Is there any way to change him back?
-有什么办法能让他复原吗？
-不知道

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:12.819
Not that I know of.
-有什么办法能让他复原吗？
-不知道

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:16.614
(low growl)

00:04:16.698 --> 00:04:19.742
-Aunt Alberta will not be pleased.
-(huffs)
艾伯塔舅妈会不高兴的

00:04:19.826 --> 00:04:22.036
REEPICHEEP: Sorry about the hand, old boy.
对不起伤了你的爪子
伙计，我有点防卫过当

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.788
I can be a little overzealous at times.
对不起伤了你的爪子
伙计，我有点防卫过当

00:04:23.871 --> 00:04:25.164
(low growl)

00:04:25.248 --> 00:04:26.833
TAVROS: The boats are ready, sire.
船已经装好了，陛下

00:04:26.916 --> 00:04:28.293
We can't leave him alone.
我们不能丢下他

00:04:28.376 --> 00:04:31.004
Well, we can't bring him on board,
Your Majesty.
可我们无法带他上船，陛下

00:04:31.087 --> 00:04:33.089
Drinian, you and the others
take one boat back.
德里宁，你和其他人坐船先走

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:34.966
The rest of us will stay
here till morning and...
我们等到明天早晨

00:04:35.049 --> 00:04:36.634
work out what to do.
再想想办法

00:04:36.718 --> 00:04:38.469
But you've no provisions
可是你们没有给养

00:04:38.553 --> 00:04:40.847
and no means of staying warm,
Your Majesty.
没有御寒之物，陛下

00:04:44.976 --> 00:04:46.060
You were saying?
谁说没有？

00:04:46.144 --> 00:04:48.605
(laughter, chuckling)
谁说没有？

00:04:54.569 --> 00:04:57.697
EDMUND: I've never seen
these constellations before.
我从来没有见过这些星座

00:04:58.823 --> 00:05:00.325
Me neither.
我也是

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:03.411
We're a long way from home.
家乡已经非常遥远

00:05:04.329 --> 00:05:07.832
When I was a boy I used to imagine sailing
to the end of the world...
小时候我做梦都想出海去世界尽头

00:05:09.959 --> 00:05:11.294
...finding my father there.
寻找我父王

00:05:14.923 --> 00:05:16.049
Maybe you will.
也许你能找到

00:05:23.014 --> 00:05:24.390
(snoring)

00:05:30.313 --> 00:05:32.315
I miss my mummy.
我想妈妈

00:05:36.819 --> 00:05:38.279
I miss mine, too.
我也想妈妈

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.532
Don't worry, you'll see her again.
别担心，你会见到她的

00:05:41.616 --> 00:05:42.951
How do you know?
你怎么知道？

00:05:43.034 --> 00:05:45.119
You just have to have faith
about these things.
只要坚信不移就能实现梦想

00:05:46.496 --> 00:05:47.997
Aslan will help us.
我们有阿斯兰保佑

00:05:51.459 --> 00:05:53.169
(sighs)

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.091
But Aslan couldn't stop
her from being taken.
可是阿斯兰没能阻止妈妈被抓走

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:01.094
We'll find her, I promise.
我们会找到她，我保证一定会的

00:06:02.553 --> 00:06:04.097
Somehow.
一定会的

00:06:13.064 --> 00:06:14.774
(waves breaking)

00:06:18.486 --> 00:06:21.155
(breathing, growling)

00:06:21.239 --> 00:06:22.699
Hmm...

00:06:25.201 --> 00:06:28.121
(crying)

00:06:31.165 --> 00:06:32.292
Trouble sleeping?
睡不着吧？

00:06:33.626 --> 00:06:35.712
Now, now.
好了

00:06:35.795 --> 00:06:38.298
All is not as lost as it seems.
还没到不可救药的地步

00:06:39.549 --> 00:06:43.219
I'll stay up with you if you wish,
keep you company.
我会永远陪伴你

00:06:45.096 --> 00:06:47.932
I'll wager you didn't even
believe in dragons this morning.
我打赌直到今早你都不相信龙的存在

00:06:48.016 --> 00:06:49.892
(chuckles)
我打赌直到今早你都不相信龙的存在

00:06:49.976 --> 00:06:51.060
Yes.
是的

00:06:52.395 --> 00:06:57.900
You know, extraordinary things
only happen to extraordinary people.
必须要经历很多的磨难

00:06:59.902 --> 00:07:01.029
Maybe it's a sign.
也许这是个兆头

00:07:02.405 --> 00:07:04.574
That you've got an extraordinary destiny.
你可能会一鸣惊人的

00:07:06.075 --> 00:07:07.535
Something...
到那时你就偷着乐吧

00:07:07.619 --> 00:07:10.288
something greater
than you could've imagined.
到那时你就偷着乐吧

00:07:10.371 --> 00:07:12.832
(chuckles)

00:07:12.915 --> 00:07:16.377
I could tell you one or two
of my adventures, if you like,
如果你愿意，给你讲讲我的冒险故事

00:07:16.461 --> 00:07:18.671
just to pass the time.
姑且用来消磨时间

00:07:18.755 --> 00:07:22.508
Believe it or not, you're not
the first dragon I've encountered.
不管你信不信
你并不是我见过的第一条龙

00:07:22.592 --> 00:07:25.261
Many years ago--
too many than I care to mention--
记不清是什么年代了

00:07:25.345 --> 00:07:27.180
I was with a band of pirates.
我和一群海盗为伍

00:07:27.263 --> 00:07:29.974
I met another dragon,
much fiercer than you...
那时我也见过一条龙
它可比你厉害多了

00:07:33.019 --> 00:07:34.646
(Eustace snores deeply)

00:07:38.816 --> 00:07:40.652
(gasps)

00:07:40.735 --> 00:07:44.405
Lucy. Lucy, wake up.
露西，醒醒

00:07:44.489 --> 00:07:46.574
-(Lucy gasps)
-Look!
你瞧

00:07:48.242 --> 00:07:49.577
The Blue Star.
蓝星

00:07:50.453 --> 00:07:52.580
-Everybody!
-What, what, what is it?
大家醒醒

00:07:52.664 --> 00:07:56.292
Everybody, wake up.
It's the Blue Star.
大家快醒醒

00:07:56.376 --> 00:07:58.086
Come on, old boy, wake up.
快点，伙计，别睡了

00:07:58.169 --> 00:07:59.254
(snorts)
快点，伙计，别睡了

